"%-5s"	"[     ]"
"%.2s"	"[]"
== the length is what decides, not the characters ==
"a"	8	8	1	"       a"
"ab"	8	8	2	"      ab"
"abc"	8	8	2	"     abc"
"é"	8	8	2	"      é"
